\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \ul What's Not Included?\cb1 \ulnone \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 No mounting bracket is provided. You can find the necessary CAD models and 3D print files to make your own bracket or modify one of the pre-made ones to fit your droid. You can find all the models here: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/reeltwo/DomeControlFirmware/tree/main/Mounts"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 https://github.com/reeltwo/DomeContr...ee/main/Mounts}}\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \ul What's Included?\cb1 \ulnone \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 Dome position encoder PCB, vinyl pattern sticker, and dome controller. There is an option for either a compact dome controller or an OLED dome controller. No mounting bracket for the position encoder is included. There are three different options for mounting brackets available with Fusion 360 files and STLs available up on Github.\cb1 \
